// en: "Light Table provides a rich set of tools and visualizations for managing your font projects. It's built on top of Git. That means that your notes, sketch files, and Python scripts can be part of your project's version history, too. Deeply integrated into Glyphs, Light Table's features are always at your fingertips. And for custom needs, there is an extensive Python API. Learn more on the [Light Table website](https://formkunft.com/light-table/)."
"description" = "Light Table 提供豐富的工具和視覺化功能來管理您的字型專案。它以 Git 為基礎建構。這表示您的筆記、草圖檔案和 Python 指令碼也可以成為專案版本歷史的一部分。深度整合到 Glyphs 中，Light Table 的功能隨時可用。若有自訂需求，還提供完整的 Python API。在 [Light Table 網站](https://formkunft.com/light-table/) 了解更多。";

// en: "visual version control with Git in Glyphs"
"label" = "在 Glyphs 中透過 Git 進行視覺化版本控制";
